| `doc_drift.history_paths` | list of strings | `["CHANGELOG.md", "docs/adr/", "docs/design/"]` | a non-empty list of non-blank path prefixes | `tests/integration/test_doc_drift.py`; `scripts/jobs/review_docs.py` (`opener_policy`) | Markdown under a listed prefix is history and may name a campaign, a slice or a moment, and review_docs reads no change opener in it. | a shipped guide, which must not | always |
